---@field all? boolean If `true`, show notifications marked as read.
---@field is_done? boolean Whether to return only done notifications (`true`) or exclude them (`false`). When omitted, notifications are not filtered by done status. Use `all=true&is_done=true` for done notifications or `all=true&is_done=false` for both read and unread inbox notifications. If `all` is omitted or `false`, `is_done=true` returns no notifications.
---@field participating? boolean If `true`, only shows notifications in which the user is directly participating or mentioned.
---@field since? string Only show results that were last updated after the given time. This is a timestamp in [ISO 8601](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) format: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ`.
---@field before? string Only show notifications updated before the given time. This is a timestamp in [ISO 8601](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) format: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ`.
